===Verb===
{{en-verb|syndicat}}

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[become]] a syndicate.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To put under the control of a group acting as a unit.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To release media content through a syndicate to be [[published]] or [[broadcast]] through multiple outlets.

